OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought over the future of
OL,4,AHull City Hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being asked their views on
OL,7,Fthe future of Hull City Hall.
OL,9,FThe city council has launched a survey
OL,10,Fto find out what people want to see at
OL,11,Fthe venue, and for feedback on its
OL,12,Ffacilities.
OL,14,FThe Grade II listed building, which
OL,15,Fopened in 1911, has hosted concerts,
OL,16,Fcomedians, community events and
OL,17,Fceremonies.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
